  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">#CoCreateDESIGN Festival 2022 South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A key objective of the yearly organised #cocreateDESIGN Festival 2022 is to be a platform for local designers, entrepreneurs and other stakeholders such as the City of Cape Town to discuss local challenges. In 2022 the focus will be on designing blue-green city solutions for African cities and supporting entrepreneurs through their ideation phase and scaling phase of their product and service development.</narrative>
  </description>
